---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import ArrowLeft from '../assets/icons/arrow-left.svg';
---

<Layout title="About Intero">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl py-10" data-testid="about-section">
    <Card class="border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-8 shadow-lg">
      <h1 class="mb-6 border-b border-slate-700 pb-4 text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-100" data-testid="about-heading">About Intero</h1>
      <div class="space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
        <p>Intero is an interior-design workspace for turning a measured room brief into a design conversation and an explorable concept. Confirmed dimensions and opening positions are supplied by you; the demo scene is illustrative rather than a CAD-accurate or photorealistic render.</p>
        <p>Uploaded floor plans are previewed locally in your current browser tab. They are not sent to Intero or retained by this demo. Provider-backed assistance sends only the design question and confirmed room summary to the provider you choose.</p>
        <p>Text suggestions from Google AI Studio or Groq do not generate or validate 3D geometry, lighting simulations, or rendered images. Add the matching server environment variable to enable a provider.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center">
        <Button href="/" class="hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-emerald-500/20" data-testid="about-back">
          <ArrowLeft class="h-5 w-5 mr-2" aria-hidden="true" />
          Back to workspace
        </Button>
      </div>
    </Card>
  </section>
</Layout>